00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:24.439
We have a planned Tulsa, Oklahoma, Trump rally
with thousands of people on Saturday.

00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:29.150
Dr. Anthony Foushee has already recommended
against going to such a rally.

