00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:47.710
And the Corona virus pandemic in some particular
states is spiking so quickly, so quickly and

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:54.230
so aggressively that the numbers almost seem
fake, but they are not fake.

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:58.590
And what I mean is when you look at these
case graphs that I'm going to show you, we

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:01.989
are more than three months into this pandemic.

00:01:01.989 --> 00:01:08.010
It's hard to believe that some states are
managing the pandemic so poorly that we are

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:13.840
now getting these spikes like these states
are nowhere near the peaks that some states

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.270
reached in early to mid April.

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:21.560
Looking at Texas, for example, I already told
you days ago that cases were spiking in Texas.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:28.240
That was nothing compared to what we are now
seeing, a record 4000 cases in one day in

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.880
Texas yesterday.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.770
These are unconscionable Nung numbers.

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:37.620
Sticking with this part of the country, Arizona
is quickly becoming the hot spot in terms

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.500
