00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:49.220
Arizona.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.400
Again, everybody's just acting like nothing's
going on.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.260
He says stores are open.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.700
People packed together.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:55.750
Nobody's wearing masks.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:59.030
Just like almost no mitigation going on at
