00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:00.960
Florida, very similar curve.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.010
Have a lot of friends in Florida very worried.

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:08.099
And again, yesterday, the worst day in Florida
