00:02:08.099 --> 00:02:10.220
Also thousands of new cases.

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:15.170
So I really need people to understand the
context here.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:21.570
We're months into this White House Corona
virus task force in place for months, mitigation

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:27.470
testing, PPE, stay at home orders, wear masks,
indoor months and months and months.

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:33.810
And yesterday was the worst day since the
start of this in Texas, Florida and Arizona.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.090
Now, it's not just red states.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:39.830
As I've mentioned, California, which was an
early hotspot.

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.500
It's still having having problems.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.360
They've not exactly flattened the curve.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.700
But even the growth rates in California are
not.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:50.340
The erratic numbers that we are seeing in
some other places.

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:55.620
Now, meanwhile, I continue to be really glad
that things are going well in some places.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.340
