00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:18.160
Lots of states are doing very well.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.430
And we'll see as they start to open.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:21.430
Whether that changes.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.650
So the point here is mitigation works.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:28.930
The cases and the deaths respond to what people
