00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.600
early May.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:59.110
We might have almost no new cases.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.110
By June 1st.

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:03.410
There were models that said by June one, there
will be almost no new cases.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:06.510
We've got 20000 thousand new cases a day in
